## 17. Detect Format and Locate Task Root

Classify Current / Legacy / Hybrid / Unknown. Current default. Legacy artifacts are compatibility inputs. Missing optional legacy artifacts are not automatic defects. Prefer user-named roots; never pick by mtime alone; never auto-pick archived/old outputs.

